 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory service: `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`,
+`quote({ itemId, start, end })` and `book({ itemId, start, end })`. Money is integer euro cents; times are UTC
+ISO-8601 strings at midnight, `end` being the start of the day after the last rented day. An item cannot be booked
+for overlapping periods. Invalid requests throw. Cancellations (no refund under 24 hours before start, else full
+refund) are not implemented yet. Run the tests with `npm test`.
